    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>It&#8217;s unique plugin from AA Production House and it is created to show your ads via shortcode like like [AD for=&#8221;BD&#8221;]Your ads here[/AD]</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Shortcode Enabled</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to use it</h4>\n<p>Insert anywhere the below shortcode</p>\n<p>[AD for=&#8221;US,CA,GB&#8221; message=&#8221;Sorry, content not available in your country.&#8221;]<br />\nThis content will only show for visitors from US, Canada, or UK.<br />\n[/AD]</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Install as regular WordPress plugin.</li>\n<li>Go your plugin setting via WordPress Dashboard and find &#8220;<strong>AA Ad by country</strong>&#8221; activate it.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Security Update</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
